$b['Cosmic Dreamer'] = 'Two panels side by side on one image, divided down the middle. LEFT PANEL: the tattoo design alone on a plain white background, shown flat exactly as described, no body, drawn large so it fills most of the panel. RIGHT PANEL: Studio photograph of a real person''s body showing the same exact tattoo where described, healed tattoo on real skin in soft even light, the rest of the body modestly covered by simple plain clothing, only the tattooed area bare, plain seamless light grey studio backdrop - no room, no furniture, no scenery. The tattoo in both panels is identical. The tattoo: Cosmic Dreamer - a serene face emerging from a galaxy of planets, stars, and flowing color. A Psychedelic Dream Worlds tattoo: psychedelic color, surreal nature, cosmic imagery, flowing shapes, dreamlike landscapes, luminous mushrooms, fluid geometry, celestial faces, vibrant organic forms and imaginative worlds, in saturated blues, purples, magentas, cyan, turquoise and warm orange or gold, with strong contrast and a clear tattoo silhouette. No text, labels, logos or watermarks in the tattoo. In the right panel it is on a woman, upper arm, a medium-to-large tattoo that still sits well inside that area, not a full sleeve.'
